.idea
.DS_Store

# runs/ledger.jsonl is deliberately TRACKED: it is the record that lets a metric
# be attributed to a change rather than to a different dataset or a different
# seed. The *.sqlite rule above would have silently swallowed a runs.sqlite,
# which is why the ledger is JSONL. See issue #4.
!runs/
!runs/ledger.jsonl

# The 382 MB NBA download. A local symlink or a real copy both belong here:
# committing either would add hundreds of megabytes to the repository.
data
